{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#card-zh","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-page-preview 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的页面预览插件，在会话回答下方把带有 page-preview 标记的 HTML 代码块呈现为可交互面板，也能通过工具打开本地 HTML 文件、含 index.html 的目录或 HTTP(S) 页面。用户可以在行内面板中收起或全屏查看，并在新窗口打开片段；浮动预览窗支持拖动、调整尺寸、全屏、刷新和切换目标。预览按会话分别保存，适合在 DSH Web 中查看模型生成的页面或正在编辑的网页项目。无需 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["page-preview.client.js:168-220","lib/index.js:213-270","page-preview.host.js:332-374"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#card-en","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-page-preview adds page previews to the DSH web client. Marked HTML fences render as interactive panes below chat turns. Tools open local files, page directories, or HTTP(S) URLs in a floating window that can be moved, resized, refreshed, or switched. Previews are kept per session.","source":"generated","evidence":["page-preview.client.js:168-220","lib/index.js:213-270","page-preview.host.js:332-374"]}
