{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#feature-1","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-page-preview 的功能「行内 HTML 预览」：将回答中的指定 HTML 代码块显示成可交互页面。生成带 page-preview 标记的代码围栏后，页面会出现在聊天内容下方，并可收起或全屏。","source":"generated","evidence":["page-preview.client.js:168-220"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#feature-2","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-page-preview 的功能「浮动页面窗口」：通过 preview_register 指定本地 HTML 文件、页面目录或 HTTP(S) 地址后，DSH 在网页界面打开浮动预览窗。窗口可拖动、调整大小和全屏查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:213-228","page-preview.client.js:300-308"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#feature-3","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-page-preview 的功能「刷新与切换页面」：本地文件编辑后调用 preview_refresh 重新载入当前预览，也可用 preview_replace 将当前会话的目标换成另一个文件、目录或网页地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:230-259"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-page-preview#feature-4","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-page-preview","commit":"ad60e96e8482636d2d1462254452245a91cc876a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-page-preview 的功能「按会话管理预览」：浮动预览注册关联当前 DSH 会话；客户端查询当前会话的注册状态，并据此显示对应预览窗，切换会话时各自的页面状态相互区分。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:108-110","page-preview.client.js:516-545"]}
